A note that the lock kept from following its paper is moved by
[[sessions reconcile]]: the append renames the paper while another
process holds the notes lock, so the note stays under the old id and
the warning says to reconcile; once the lock is free, the reconcile
moves it, because the session recorded the rename.  The lock is held by
a real other process, as in the notes chapter's tests.

