never be seen.  Nor does the read record a baseline
([[record_baseline=False]]): the merge compares with the baseline of
the session being saved, never with the file's own, and the file's
would cost a paper state per paper on every save: a quarter of a
second on the largest real session (measured with [[SessionBaseline]]
above), which [[scholar enrich]] saves after every fifty papers, some
two hundred times in a full run.

