through [[create_review_session]] saves into the file it loaded (a
renamed copy, continued under its file name with [[-n]]) and leaves the
files that are not its own byte for byte alone (another session's file
named like its query, an unnamed session's hash file named like its
name, a file named like its query holding another query); and the
warning comes once.

