The record of a human's review (\cref{sec:human-review-record}) adds a
note to the rows of the sources that claim a human while any of their
decisions lacks one, and nothing once every one has it.  It does not
touch the audit table: which row is cited still follows the source, so
the table is the same, byte for byte, with or without the records.

